  m_Name: MainLobbyWelcomeTerminal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Terminal
  lines:
  - WELCOME TO UNTEL - Doing more with less!
  - 'We are pleased to confirm that you have arrived at your assigned facility. Your
    objective is simple:'
  - Maintenance Request #8472 -Investigate tool/equipment fault and restore operations.
  - 'Please note that facility conditions may vary. Remain alert and use your best
    judgement when selecting a route. '
  - 'Basic Controls: WASD - move, Mouse - aim/fire, E - interact, I - inventory,
    ESC - pause'
  - Thank you for being a valued member of the Untel team!
